{
  "schema": "GS-GENERAL-BATCH-V1",
  "batch_id": "G-card-lines-20261104-006",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "office-voice",
      "id": "4_1_101_01_a1001",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "お仕事のオファーがありました。\nご確認お願いします！",
      "sourceHash": "b6fbadd850259221cdf91afe4c129611722c0bf4987b78fcdfb19e8603167ac4",
      "speaker": "101ken",
      "key": "metadata:v1:office-voice:text:b6fbadd850259221cdf91afe4c129611722c0bf4987b78fcdfb19e8603167ac4",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "office-voice",
          "id": "4_1_101_01_a1001",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "101ken"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "office-voice",
      "id": "4_1_101_00_a1000",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "お疲れさまです、\n●●●●プロデューサーさん。\n今日のログインボーナスはこちらです！",
      "sourceHash": "c4e1e939771a2c12a744a208a45aae90d2603b303ac21213afed96cbe426f374",
      "speaker": "101ken",
      "key": "metadata:v1:office-voice:text:c4e1e939771a2c12a744a208a45aae90d2603b303ac21213afed96cbe426f374",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "office-voice",
          "id": "4_1_101_00_a1000",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "101ken"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "office-voice",
      "id": "4_1_101_02_a1002",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "お疲れさまです！\n今日はインテリボーナスデーです！",
      "sourceHash": "db31239a07cc040dcc241539994d746557fd7d109796aa3ba85fac24c1616e75",
      "speaker": "101ken",
      "key": "metadata:v1:office-voice:text:db31239a07cc040dcc241539994d746557fd7d109796aa3ba85fac24c1616e75",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "office-voice",
          "id": "4_1_101_02_a1002",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "101ken"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "office-voice",
      "id": "4_1_101_01_a1000",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "お疲れさまです！\n今日のお仕事はこちらになります。",
      "sourceHash": "ffcbf978300b935b9afdbbb71c8c182da248e5814866548b811239eb33136f19",
      "speaker": "101ken",
      "key": "metadata:v1:office-voice:text:ffcbf978300b935b9afdbbb71c8c182da248e5814866548b811239eb33136f19",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "office-voice",
          "id": "4_1_101_01_a1000",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "101ken"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_05",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "プロデューサー君、おはよう！\n気持ちの良い挨拶から始める\n仕事は、いいものだな！",
      "sourceHash": "0b2ee2fe478594ef68998c068960f2a8bc4037208ec8dd87ed9669501ce889a1",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:0b2ee2fe478594ef68998c068960f2a8bc4037208ec8dd87ed9669501ce889a1",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_05",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_04",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "トレーナーに、声量を\n褒められたぞ！　さらに練習に\n励まねばな！",
      "sourceHash": "13478dae354ca3623039c6dc5e33216a54f2bbb9ee0bf398d7e047fefd23ca79",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:13478dae354ca3623039c6dc5e33216a54f2bbb9ee0bf398d7e047fefd23ca79",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_04",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_06",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "君の仕事ぶりには感謝するが\n自身のことも大事にしたまえ。\n君もまた、唯一の存在だからな。",
      "sourceHash": "6ad77aca0effe93b9d80bb631439501bdbfadc873bdfed91c6fa99ee9c3693ee",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:6ad77aca0effe93b9d80bb631439501bdbfadc873bdfed91c6fa99ee9c3693ee",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_06",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_03",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "賢と釣りに行くことになった。\n無論、アイドルたるもの、\n日焼けには注意しなければな！",
      "sourceHash": "719a102a651fcf84c625d536c6ff94e450d5dd6764a3cc2d30de8dcb3371ab82",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:719a102a651fcf84c625d536c6ff94e450d5dd6764a3cc2d30de8dcb3371ab82",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_03",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_12",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "遅くまでご苦労！　君の頑張りが\nあるから、我々アイドルも\n仕事に傾注できるのだ！",
      "sourceHash": "77b218541d0f6c06181cb60a4fdca29efe20946854bfacef5eb5408cd632fae2",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:77b218541d0f6c06181cb60a4fdca29efe20946854bfacef5eb5408cd632fae2",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_12",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_07",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "今日もそろそろ折り返しだ。\n残された時間も有意義に\n過ごそうではないか！",
      "sourceHash": "77e175be206ad1fbfc3137ffce08c8d97a104698530c58fb2403f4df48c10e2f",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:77e175be206ad1fbfc3137ffce08c8d97a104698530c58fb2403f4df48c10e2f",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_07",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_11",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "プロデューサー君、いい所に。\nSNSに載せる写真だが、どちらの\nポーズが映えるか判定を頼む！",
      "sourceHash": "85a1ac8c9780e308c730d09e0f3a4efa848da674867cd60d15a466e53460ed28",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:85a1ac8c9780e308c730d09e0f3a4efa848da674867cd60d15a466e53460ed28",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_11",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_01",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "うむ、呼んだか？\n……違う？　もしや、君ではなく\n君のパッションの叫びか？",
      "sourceHash": "94aba2a66a88ed0abc265d3f7f63785882d3fc13c5f728ca9334a16b216b2fec",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:94aba2a66a88ed0abc265d3f7f63785882d3fc13c5f728ca9334a16b216b2fec",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_01",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_09",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "君のパッションには感心する。\n今度、アイドル論をとことん\n語り合いたいものだ！",
      "sourceHash": "95523737f5124acbdba2f50290da712681238f4543c6799e4164e21754e0ad9a",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:95523737f5124acbdba2f50290da712681238f4543c6799e4164e21754e0ad9a",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_09",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_02",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "私がアイドルとして輝くには\n君の力がなくてはならない。\n頼んだぞ、プロデューサー君！",
      "sourceHash": "acf6cd53819e9aa9854575ba2153c7043b67cb5ed41062b65002c5189f8be401",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:acf6cd53819e9aa9854575ba2153c7043b67cb5ed41062b65002c5189f8be401",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_02",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_14",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "外のベンチでうたた寝をした？\n春眠暁を覚えずと言うが、\n体は冷やさないようにな！",
      "sourceHash": "b0927c79027a702ad8d457a6e4dc897bc6b8fa068fb9081c2ef54947be38f27f",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:b0927c79027a702ad8d457a6e4dc897bc6b8fa068fb9081c2ef54947be38f27f",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_14",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_10",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "アイドル、ファン、スタッフ……\n皆のパッションがひとつとなり\n最高のステージが完成するのだ！",
      "sourceHash": "bd73511012afa6ac827215e8dbdc9263b7f8c15429b85bafe305c2222e125595",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:bd73511012afa6ac827215e8dbdc9263b7f8c15429b85bafe305c2222e125595",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_10",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_08",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "昼食がまだなら、一緒に\nたまこやの弁当を\n買いに行かないか？",
      "sourceHash": "bd9b7a63364f4e1379e6487d0b399c04ed5c7cdcfcad3ffaa7abbd1d048774fa",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:bd9b7a63364f4e1379e6487d0b399c04ed5c7cdcfcad3ffaa7abbd1d048774fa",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_08",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_00",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "トップアイドルの座を掴むため、\n共に励もうではないか！\n君の活躍を期待しているぞ！",
      "sourceHash": "d08c2641a31b63584b6f63a5d62bb51d0f214f9aa37f94b7115c312307c79297",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:d08c2641a31b63584b6f63a5d62bb51d0f214f9aa37f94b7115c312307c79297",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_00",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "unused-voice",
      "id": "3_1_102_13",
      "field": "text",
      "source": "花見に行くなら、私が特製の\n栄養ドリンクを用意しよう！\n体の芯から元気になるぞ！",
      "sourceHash": "f5bffb54a5a5e6089c962495d0879b50ae4c213d1c32ca038cd2c89e7a1e152e",
      "speaker": "102sha",
      "key": "metadata:v1:unused-voice:text:f5bffb54a5a5e6089c962495d0879b50ae4c213d1c32ca038cd2c89e7a1e152e",
      "references": [
        {
          "kind": "unused-voice",
          "id": "3_1_102_13",
          "field": "text",
          "speaker": "102sha"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "source_digest": "f96d45a9456ad3bc1f2b409c585f8f61c6fafae22b51829f76678dcd1c36a571",
  "input_sha256": "c06a0037b7e4e2c3be94ef787be8d1078ba4cc4dc50e0b0292467a8e24d16f47",
